              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ũvu 1.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na neew’a wasya ũkyuma ĩtunĩ, ta wasya wa iw’ũ nyingĩ, na wasya wa kĩtundumo kĩnene: na wasya ũla neewie waĩ ta wasya wa aingi ma mbeve makĩinga mbeve syoo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
